{"entry_id": "term-279", "model_a": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001:action-basic", "model_b": "claude-sonnet-4-6:default", "winner": "b", "score_a": {"accuracy": 4, "fluency": 1}, "score_b": {"accuracy": 5, "fluency": 5}, "translation_a": "# 预测误差\n\n```{index} forecast error\n```\n\n预测误差是实际值与预测值之间的差异。\n\n$$\ne_t = y_t - \\hat{y}_t\n$$\n\n其中 $y_t$ 是时间 $t$ 的实际值，$\\hat{y}_t$ 是预测值。\n\n## 误差度量\n\n常见的误差度量包括：\n\n### 平均绝对误差 (MAE)\n\n$$\n\\text{MAE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}|e_t|\n$$\n\n### 均方误差 (MSE)\n\n$$\n\\text{MSE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}e_t^2\n$$\n\n### 均方根误差 (RMSE)\n\n$$\n\\text{RMSE} = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}e_t^2}\n$$\n\n### 平均绝对百分比误差 (MAPE)\n\n$$\n\\text{MAPE} = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\left|\\frac{e_t}{y_t}\\right| \\times 100\\%\n$$\n\n## 误差的性质\n\n理想的预测模型应具有以下特性：\n\n- 误差均值接近零\n- 误差方差恒定（同方差性）\n- 误差相互独立\n- 误差服从正态分布", "translation_b": "预测误差", "reference": "预测误差", "domain": "statistics", "difficulty": "intermediate", "timestamp": "2026-10-22T14:12:39.231810+00:00", "cli_version": "0.6.0"}
